{"step_index":103,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-23T18:41:25Z","thinking":"**Prioritizing Tool Usage**\n\nI'm now focusing on tool selection, understanding that choosing the right tool is key. My aim is to leverage the most specialized tool available for each specific task to avoid unnecessary complexity. The broader tools will be considered only when a specific tool does not exist. I'm carefully analyzing the available tools to ensure I pick the most efficient one.\n\n\n**Refining Tool Choices**\n\nI'm now implementing new tool selection rules, especially concerning `cat`, `grep`, `ls`, and `sed`, avoiding their use within bash commands where possible. I've updated my process to include a critical step of listing all related tools before making tool calls, ensuring I choose the most specific ones. Currently, I'm working on updating `frontend/app.js` to change the row styling to include a hover effect.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n    const refreshBtn = document.getElementById('refreshBtn');\n    const loader = document.getElementById('loader');\n    const dashboardContent = document.getElementById('dashboardContent');\n    const conjunctionTableBody = document.getElementById('conjunctionTableBody');\n    const errorState = document.getElementById('errorState');\n    const errorMessage = document.getElementById('errorMessage');\n\n    // Backend API URL\n    const API_URL = 'http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/conjunctions';\n\n    const fetchConjunctionData = async () => {\n        // UI Reset\n        loader.classList.remove('hidden');\n        dashboardContent.classList.add('hidden');\n        errorState.classList.add('hidden');\n        conjunctionTableBody.innerHTML = '';\n\n        try {\n            const response = await fetch(API_URL);\n            \n            if (!response.ok) {\n                throw new Error(`HTTP error! status: ${response.status}`);\n            }\n            \n            const data = await response.json();\n            \n            if (data.conjunctions && data.conjunctions.length > 0) {\n                renderTable(data.conjunctions);\n                // Slight delay before showing content to ensure smooth glide-up animation\n                setTimeout(() => {\n                    dashboardContent.classList.remove('hidden');\n                }, 100);\n            } else {\n                showError(\"No conjunction data found.\");\n            }\n        } catch (error) {\n            console.error(\"Error fetching data:\", error);\n            showError(\"Failed to connect to the telemetry server. Retrying...\");\n        } finally {\n            loader.classList.add('hidden');\n        }\n    };\n\n    const renderTable = (conjunctions) => {\n        conjunctions.forEach(item => {\n            const row = document.createElement('tr');\n            \n            // Base row styling with cinematic hover\n            row.className = 'hover:bg-white/10 transition duration-300';\n\n            // Risk Level Styling\n            let riskBadgeClass = '';\n            if (item.risk_level === 'CRITICAL') {\n                riskBadgeClass = 'bg-red-600 text-white px-3 py-1 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold animate-pulse shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(220,38,38,0.9)] rounded-sm';\n                row.className += ' bg-red-900/30 hover:bg-red-900/50'; // critical row highlight\n            } else if (item.risk_level === 'Medium') {\n                riskBadgeClass = 'bg-yellow-500/20 text-yellow-400 border border-yellow-500/50 px-3 py-1 rounded-sm text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold';\n            } else {\n                riskBadgeClass = 'bg-green-500/10 text-green-400 border border-green-500/30 px-3 py-1 rounded-sm text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold';\n            }\n\n            const date = new Date(item.closest_approach_time);\n            \n            // Format to a clean sleek date: \"SEP 24, 10:46 UTC\"\n            const dateOpts = { month: 'short', day: 'numeric', hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit', timeZone: 'UTC' };\n            const formattedDate = date.toLocaleString('en-US', dateOpts).toUpperCase() + ' UTC';\n\n            row.innerHTML = `\n                <td class=\"p-5 font-semibold tracking-wide\">${item.object1}</td>\n                <td class=\"p-5 font-semibold tracking-wide\">${item.object2}</td>\n                <td class=\"p-5 text-gray-300 font-light tracking-wider\">${formattedDate}</td>\n                <td class=\"p-5 font-mono text-right text-lg font-light tracking-wider\">${item.min_distance_km.toFixed(2)}</td>\n                <td class=\"p-5 text-center\">\n                    <span class=\"${riskBadgeClass} inline-block\">${item.risk_level}</span>\n                </td>\n            `;\n            conjunctionTableBody.appendChild(row);\n        });\n    };\n\n    const showError = (message) => {\n        errorMessage.textContent = message;\n        errorState.classList.remove('hidden');\n    };\n\n    // Initial fetch\n    fetchConjunctionData();\n\n    // Attach event listener\n    refreshBtn.addEventListener('click', fetchConjunctionData);\n});","Description":"Updated app.js for refined cinematic styling and formatting.","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/Users/anandgopaltiwary/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/space_debris_prototype/frontend/app.js","toolAction":"Overwriting app.js","toolSummary":"Frontend JS overhaul"}}]}
