{"step_index":112,"source":"USER_EXPLICIT","type":"USER_INPUT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-23T18:53:27Z","content":"<USER_REQUEST>\nCopy and paste this exact prompt into Antigravity to combine both features into a unified, high-tech command center using a tabbed interface:\n\n\"I want to keep our existing 'Live Conjunction Analysis' table but add the new 'Mission Risk Calculator' alongside it. Let's build a unified, single-page command center with a sleek Tabbed interface.\n\nPlease update index.html, app.js, and the Tailwind CSS with these exact requirements:\n\nTabbed Navigation: Below the top minimalist header, create a sleek, glassmorphism tab menu with two options: 'LIVE TRACKING' and 'RISK CALCULATOR'. Ensure the active tab has a glowing bottom border to indicate which view is open.\n\nView 1: Live Tracking (Existing Feature): Move our current data table (the one fetching from FastAPI with the Red/Yellow/Green dynamic badges and the simulated 1.2km critical risk) into this first tab. It should look exactly like our premium glass panel design.\n\nView 2: Risk Calculator (New Feature): When the second tab is clicked, hide the table and show the new Calcimator-style calculator.\n\nLeft Panel (Inputs): Target Altitude (km), Cross-Sectional Area (m²), Time in Orbit (years), and a 'Calculate' button.\n\nRight Panel (Results): Probability of Impact (%), Risk Level Badge, and a visual Risk Meter.\n\nWrite vanilla JS to handle the tab switching smoothly (without reloading the page) and to perform the mock risk math when 'Calculate' is clicked.\n\nUnified Styling: Keep the SpaceX-style cinematic background image and dark overlay for the entire page. Ensure both tabs use the same translucent bg-black/40 and backdrop-blur-md glassmorphism effect for consistency.\n\nAction: Update the HTML, JS, and CSS to integrate both features. Once running, use your embedded browser to click the 'RISK CALCULATOR' tab, input some test numbers, click calculate, and take a full-screen screenshot of the calculator view so I can see the new feature in action.\"\n</USER_REQUEST>\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\nThe current local time is: 2026-09-24T00:23:27+05:30.\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>"}
{"step_index":113,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-23T18:53:27Z","thinking":"**Prioritizing Tool Usage**\n\nI'm now focusing on tool selection, understanding that choosing the right tool is key. My aim is to leverage the most specialized tool available for each specific task to avoid unnecessary complexity. The broader tools will be considered only when a specific tool does not exist. I'm carefully analyzing the available tools to ensure I pick the most efficient one.\n\n\n**Refining Interface Strategy**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on integrating the \"Live Tracking\" table and \"Risk Calculator\" into a tabbed interface. I'm focusing on \"LIVE TRACKING\" and \"RISK CALCULATOR\" tabs, and the active tab will have a glowing border. I'm recalling the importance of specific tool selection, and am considering which tools might be most appropriate for implementing this tabbed layout, while also considering how to best handle the styling of the active tab. I am avoiding more general tools if there are specific tools available.\n\n\n**Designing Tabbed Interface**\n\nI'm now implementing the tabbed interface using HTML. I'll use buttons for tabs, with styling to indicate the active selection. I'm focusing on \"Live Tracking\" and \"Risk Calculator\" for the initial setup, ensuring a smooth transition between them without page reloads using JavaScript. I will also incorporate unified styling, including the cinematic background. This includes overwriting `index.html` and `app.js`.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Orbital Guard // Command Center</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #000;\n        }\n        .bg-cinematic {\n            background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.4), rgba(0,0,0,0.85)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1614730321146-b6fa6a46bcb4?q=80&w=2000');\n            background-size: cover;\n            background-position: center;\n            background-attachment: fixed;\n        }\n        @keyframes glideUp {\n            0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }\n            100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n        }\n        .animate-glide-up {\n            animation: glideUp 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;\n        }\n        \n        /* Custom range slider styling */\n        input[type=range] {\n            -webkit-appearance: none;\n            width: 100%;\n            background: transparent;\n        }\n        input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb {\n            -webkit-appearance: none;\n            height: 16px;\n            width: 16px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            background: #fff;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            margin-top: -6px;\n            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\n        }\n        input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-runnable-track {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 4px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n        input[type=range]:focus {\n            outline: none;\n        }\n\n        /* Custom scrollbar */\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar {\n            width: 8px;\n        }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n        }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n            border-radius: 4px;\n        }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-cinematic text-white antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col\">\n    \n    <!-- Minimalist Header -->\n    <header class=\"pt-8 px-6 md:px-8 w-full z-10 flex flex-col items-center\">\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-6xl flex items-center justify-between\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-white shadow-sm\">\n                Orbital Guard <span class=\"text-gray-400 font-light\">// Command Center</span>\n            </h1>\n            <!-- Action Button for Live Tracking only (hidden in calculator mode) -->\n            <button id=\"refreshBtn\" class=\"border border-white/40 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white text-white px-5 py-2 transition duration-300 uppercase tracking-widest text-xs font-semibold rounded-none backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                Refresh Live Data\n            </button>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Tab Navigation -->\n        <nav class=\"w-full max-w-6xl mt-8 flex space-x-12 border-b border-white/10\">\n            <button id=\"tabLive\" class=\"pb-3 text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase transition duration-300 border-b-2 border-white text-white drop-shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,255,255,0.8)] shadow-white/50\">\n                Live Tracking\n            </button>\n            <button id=\"tabCalc\" class=\"pb-3 text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase transition duration-300 border-b-2 border-transparent text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-300\">\n                Risk Calculator\n            </button>\n        </nav>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"flex-grow container mx-auto px-4 py-8 flex flex-col items-center relative z-10 w-full max-w-6xl\">\n        \n        <!-- ============================== -->\n        <!-- VIEW 1: LIVE TRACKING TABLE    -->\n        <!-- ============================== -->\n        <div id=\"viewLive\" class=\"w-full animate-glide-up\">\n            <!-- Loader -->\n            <div id=\"loader\" class=\"flex justify-center items-center py-20 w-full\">\n                <div class=\"animate-spin rounded-full h-12 w-12 border-b-2 border-white\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Error State -->\n            <div id=\"errorState\" class=\"hidden w-full bg-red-900/50 backdrop-blur-md border border-red-500/50 text-red-200 p-6 mb-6\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-3 text-lg\">\n                    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation\"></i>\n                    <span id=\"errorMessage\">Failed to load data from the server.</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Data Table -->\n            <div id=\"dashboardContent\" class=\"hidden w-full\">\n                <div class=\"bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 shadow-2xl overflow-hidden\">\n                    <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                        <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse whitespace-nowrap\">\n                            <thead>\n                                <tr class=\"bg-white/5 border-b border-white/10 text-gray-300 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest\">\n                                    <th class=\"p-5 font-semibold\">Primary Object</th>\n                                    <th class=\"p-5 font-semibold\">Secondary Object</th>\n                                    <th class=\"p-5 font-semibold\">Time of Approach (UTC)</th>\n                                    <th class=\"p-5 font-semibold text-right\">Distance (km)</th>\n                                    <th class=\"p-5 font-semibold text-center\">Status</th>\n                                </tr>\n                            </thead>\n                            <tbody id=\"conjunctionTableBody\" class=\"divide-y divide-white/5 text-sm\">\n                                <!-- Rows injected here via JS -->\n                            </tbody>\n                        </table>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- ============================== -->\n        <!-- VIEW 2: RISK CALCULATOR        -->\n        <!-- ============================== -->\n        <div id=\"viewCalc\" class=\"hidden w-full max-w-5xl grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 animate-glide-up mt-4 mx-auto\">\n            \n            <!-- Left Panel: Inputs -->\n            <div class=\"bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 p-8 shadow-2xl flex flex-col\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-lg uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold mb-6 text-gray-300 border-b border-white/10 pb-4\">Mission Parameters</h2>\n                \n                <div class=\"space-y-8 flex-grow\">\n                    <!-- Target Altitude -->\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between mb-2\">\n                            <label class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-wider font-light text-gray-400\">Target Altitude</label>\n                            <span id=\"valAltitude\" class=\"text-sm font-mono text-white\">600 km</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <input type=\"range\" id=\"inputAltitude\" min=\"200\" max=\"2000\" step=\"50\" value=\"600\" class=\"w-full\">\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Cross-Sectional Area -->\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between mb-2\">\n                            <label class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-wider font-light text-gray-400\">Spacecraft Area</label>\n                            <span id=\"valArea\" class=\"text-sm font-mono text-white\">10 m²</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <input type=\"range\" id=\"inputArea\" min=\"1\" max=\"100\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\" class=\"w-full\">\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Time in Orbit -->\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between mb-2\">\n                            <label class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-wider font-light text-gray-400\">Time in Orbit</label>\n                            <span id=\"valTime\" class=\"text-sm font-mono text-white\">5 years</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <input type=\"range\" id=\"inputTime\" min=\"1\" max=\"25\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" class=\"w-full\">\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"calculateBtn\" class=\"mt-10 w-full bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 border border-white/40 hover:border-white text-white py-4 transition duration-300 uppercase tracking-widest text-sm font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.3)]\">\n                    Calculate Risk\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Panel: Results -->\n            <div class=\"bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 p-8 shadow-2xl flex flex-col justify-between\">\n                <div>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-lg uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold mb-6 text-gray-300 border-b border-white/10 pb-4\">Risk Assessment</h2>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-col items-center\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 mb-2\">Probability of Impact</span>\n                        <div id=\"probValue\" class=\"text-6xl font-light tracking-wider font-mono text-white drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,255,255,0.3)] transition-all duration-500\">\n                            --%\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"mt-10\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 mb-2\">\n                            <span>Risk Meter</span>\n                            <span id=\"riskBadge\" class=\"px-2 py-0.5 border border-gray-500/50 text-gray-400 rounded-sm font-semibold transition-all duration-500\">STANDBY</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <!-- Progress Bar Background -->\n                        <div class=\"w-full h-2 bg-white/10 overflow-hidden mt-2\">\n                            <!-- Progress Bar Fill -->\n                            <div id=\"riskMeterFill\" class=\"h-full w-0 bg-gray-500 transition-all duration-1000 ease-out shadow-[0_0_10px_currentColor]\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"mt-8 text-xs text-gray-500 tracking-wider font-light text-center leading-relaxed\">\n                    Calculation based on empirical orbital density models, cross-sectional collision probability integration, and mission duration.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>","Description":"Created tabbed interface combining Live Tracking and Risk Calculator.","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/Users/anandgopaltiwary/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/space_debris_prototype/frontend/index.html","toolAction":"Rewriting index.html","toolSummary":"Tabbed UI setup"}}]}
